  message = ''
    A new module is available: 'programs.neverest'.

    Neverest is a CLI to synchronize mails, contacts and calendars into a
    local store that offline frontends such as Himalaya read. An account
    is enabled through 'accounts.email.accounts.<name>.neverest.enable',
    'accounts.contact.accounts.<name>.neverest.enable' or
    'accounts.calendar.accounts.<name>.neverest.enable', which fill its
    IMAP, SMTP, CardDAV or CalDAV settings.

    See https://github.com/pimalaya/neverest for more.
  '';
}
